"prose": [
{
"from": 220,
"to": 229,
"text": "The fence runs in this order: 1. host prerequisites; 2. the `conductor-verify` tier; 3. the leg's lint; 4. the round (the operator slot, step 11); 5. the evidence-graded `conductor-run` tier; 6. the workspace gates; 7. supply chain; 8. evidence hygiene; 9. the operator pass."
},
{
"from": 231,
"to": 234,
"text": "The `conductor-run` suites sit AFTER the round because the re-round's graded tests read its evidence (step 8). There is no self-verify entry, because no UI changes. The smoke is the mint-then-read `status` of leg F's run id. Every live leg is preceded by the non-priming `preconditions` probe; `pulse-app` itself is launched and stopped by step 11, never by an entry."
}
],
